guide forever/class/warrior/haggards-weapons
title Haggard's Weapons
category Class
class Warrior
folder Warrior
faction Alliance
levels 10-11
zone Stormwind City
keywords Defensive Stance, Bartleby, Harry Burlguard, Marshal Haggard, Dead-tooth Jack, Haggard's Axe, Haggard's Hammer, Haggard's Dagger, Haggard's Sword, Warrior, class weapon
reward item 6979 6983 6980 6985
reward spell 71 "Defensive Stance"
why Defensive Stance and a one-hand weapon of your choice at 10.

# Marshal Haggard and Dead-tooth Jack (1666, 1667): the weapon at the end of
# the Alliance Defensive Stance quests (1638, 1639, 1640, 1665).
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json and items.json for the chain,
# places and the key (Dead-tooth's Key, item 6783, drops from Dead-Tooth Jack
# and opens his strongbox); Forever's Warrior class quest list
# (data/local/quest-audit/) for the rewards: Bartleby's
# Mug (1665) teaches Defensive Stance, Dead-tooth Jack lets you choose Haggard's
# Axe, Hammer, Dagger or Sword.
# The leveling guides do the Defensive Stance quests for every Alliance race in
# Stormwind (02-westfall, dwarf-gnome/01-dun-morogh, nightelf/01-teldrassil);
# this guide repeats them for anyone off the route, then adds the weapon.
# Vejrek (1678, Ironforge) and Vorlus Vilehoof (1683, Darnassus) are the other
# Defensive Stance quests; the game offers only one of the three, and the
# routes take Bartleby's.

step Defensive Stance
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Ilsa Corbin trains warriors in Old Town; Harry Burlguard and Bartleby stand together by the Pig and Whistle Tavern there. Bartleby fights you for his mug.
  accept 1638 npc 5480                        -- Ilsa Corbin
  turnin 1638                                 -- Harry Burlguard
  accept 1639
  turnin 1639                                 -- Bartleby
  accept 1640
  kill 6090 quest 1640.1                      -- Beat Bartleby
  turnin 1640
  accept 1665
  turnin 1665                                 -- Harry Burlguard: Defensive Stance
  accept 1666

step Marshal Haggard
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip Marshal Haggard's house is in eastern Elwynn Forest, south of the road from Stormwind to Redridge.
  turnin 1666                                 -- Marshal Haggard
  accept 1667

step Dead-tooth Jack
  tip Dead-Tooth Jack camps in the far south-east of Elwynn Forest, south-east of Marshal Haggard. He carries the key to the strongbox in his camp.
  kill 6093                                   -- Dead-Tooth Jack: his key opens the strongbox
  collect 6782 quest 1667.1                   -- Dead-tooth's Strongbox

step Back to Marshal Haggard
  turnin 1667 choose 6979 6983 6980 6985      -- Marshal Haggard
